# Tabala (Muixeranga)

Read **AGENTS.md** at the repo root before non-trivial changes.

- Monorepo: `:core`, `:server`, `:app:shared`, `:app:webApp` (v1 scope); `:app:androidApp` and `:app:desktopApp` are out of v1 scope.
- **Koin** for DI; **SQLite** on server (Flyway/SQLDelight, schema v0.2); Ktor JSON API; **Google Sign-In (OIDC) + own JWT/refresh sessions** verified on server (**no Firebase**).
- Shared UI + ViewModels in `app/shared/src/commonMain`; platform code in `*Main` source sets only when needed.
- Banned: Firebase, Exposed, Hilt, Dagger, Metro, Room, Retrofit for new code, XML screens, Navigation 3.
- Server owns authoritative data; web client keeps access tokens in memory only (no localStorage) and no native SQLite.
- Source of truth for product/API: `docs/especificacion-tecnica.md` (v1.3) and `docs/decisiones.md`.
- Smallest correct diff; do not commit unless the user asks.
